---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import StructuredData from '../components/StructuredData.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - Aaron Brazier"
  description="Data scientist at BP recently doing more forward deployed engineering work. Building ML systems, tinkering with homelabs, and occasionally writing about it."
>
  <StructuredData type="person" data={{}} />
  <main class="content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    </header>

    <article class="about-content prose">
      <p>
        I'm a structural engineer turned data scientist at BP, recently doing
        more forward deployed engineering work. I build ML systems that run in
        production, tinker with homelabs, and occasionally write about both.
      </p>
      <p>
        My most interesting work involves time series anomaly detection—I was
        lucky to led the development of an anomaly detection method that is
        patent pending. So that's cool.
      </p>
      <p>
        At home, I run a 3-node Proxmox cluster with nearly 250TB of storage.
        It's overkill for what I need, but that's kind of the point. I've built
        out CI/CD pipelines, monitoring, and home automation—partly because it's
        useful, mostly because it's fun.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/RunOnYourOwn">GitHub</a>,
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/aaronbrazier">LinkedIn</a>, or reach me
        at <a href="mailto:aaronbrazier@gmail.com">aaronbrazier@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-content a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .about-content a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content {
      padding: 5rem 1rem 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
